   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Import / export: three templates via FL-16b. 'Components': Component ID, Caption, Component type, SAP material, Valid from, Valid to. 'Groups and options': MK,\nGroup ID, Group caption, Kind, Mode, Condition, Option ID, Option caption, Route type, Plant, Semi-finished key, Component ID, Declared as component, Offset, Valid\nfrom, Valid to. 'Rates': MK, Group ID, Scope (GLOBAL or region element ID), Option ID, Rate %, Effective from. A rate set is accepted or rejected as a whole;\npreview groups rows by set with the check result per set.",
   "originalText": "Import / export: three templates via FL-16b. 'Components': Component ID, Caption, Component type, SAP material, Valid from, Valid to. 'Groups and options': MK,\nGroup ID, Group caption, Kind, Mode, Condition, Option ID, Option caption, Route type, Plant, Semi-finished key, Component ID, Declared as component, Offset, Valid\nfrom, Valid to. 'Rates': MK, Group ID, Scope (GLOBAL or region element ID), Option ID, Rate %, Effective from. A rate set is accepted or rejected as a whole;\npreview groups rows by set with the check result per set.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s30t-92",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1470,
   "width": 1394.4,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
