   "text": "Server decides: every rate and structure check (sums, completeness, global set, overlaps, plant and component validity), whether a routing group may be added, which\nrate set applies per region and month (group-level fallback), routing-group precedence over the PM Plant attribute, ordered versus remainder, proposals and their\nwindow, recalculation.",
   "originalText": "Server decides: every rate and structure check (sums, completeness, global set, overlaps, plant and component validity), whether a routing group may be added, which\nrate set applies per region and month (group-level fallback), routing-group precedence over the PM Plant attribute, ordered versus remainder, proposals and their\nwindow, recalculation.",
